{"id":276110287,"title":"251 .注册路径-中间件案例-文件上传-请求参数解析","summary":"express-中间件-注册路径匹配的中间件（掌握）","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783060937955-ba70e76c-fc60-4eeb-95fd-d6cbb52e3164.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件-注册路径匹配的中间件（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783061697525-e5366394-4c6f-491f-b3bf-deeed4bfebe3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783061704027-acd6f94b-2366-4856-a893-cb1ea1f96ccf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个路径匹配中间件只对路径限制，对请求方式没有限制</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783061800726-396a6efb-ad82-45bd-a090-0465553c4cf9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件-路径和方法匹配-注册多个中间件（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783062071029-9f50c1dc-fcf4-430d-93bd-1dd6a969ee0e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>案例3：</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783062279022-3d1b5ece-6b8c-4c44-bea0-cee851720cae.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783062292459-bcecf8be-ab55-4705-a68b-40c11702c44d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>案例4：（有next才会往下面去执行）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783062508786-3fe768bd-666c-4a17-96c4-4a7e0292a7a3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件-中间件匹配练习（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>现在我们这里写了6个中间件</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783062969323-47c9b25b-35f3-47f3-9ae3-77905e4db667.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如果随便写一个条件去匹配的话：如果没有next的话，就只会匹配一个，不会往下走了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063034817-e4b0c03d-2366-44de-8bc3-c6a56a2de40e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063057425-e85cdd4d-e5da-49ed-b653-2efaf2863892.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>两个都符号，他只会匹配第一个，普通的都匹配。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063166351-bac0d173-b14b-42f4-b856-7b3f4f547a13.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件-中间件案例练习和Json解析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>我们要启动服务器后（注册和登录）<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063740629-a62a2a43-1103-406b-8602-458d0428dbb1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063752552-f2608b4f-4968-4c5c-ba00-06d310789597.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063774819-dc99e3ff-0737-4e06-85f5-f2cbaa25713b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063843203-ba7bf1dd-e496-41ab-a7ed-88fad8eb44ed.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063896474-113baa08-aaf1-4eac-9ca9-7752347331dc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们做一个逻辑判断。（req要把我们的json数据解析出来）<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783063974450-fed7b022-8eca-4695-9202-ab6592e19805.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>用户注册：<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064032396-a9b75dff-7c7f-4a98-8815-05f4e052d58b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064088899-853a8a82-bd7d-4c49-bf20-693b67b0e7a7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064097301-4660e377-50dd-4a9d-8639-9cfdb301faee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>中间件案例（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">重构</font>）</p>\n<p>我们最主要的问题：我们需要通过req.on方式，从我们的req里面去获取数据，然后再去解析数据</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064178164-91c14171-731d-440f-b05f-5dd2a69a458c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064355662-03f9e9d4-f40e-413e-9b95-6d7a6c3455b4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064371619-138e7a52-83d4-4f4e-a36f-c0ea0bec7d20.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064392996-e04cfe4b-73fd-4450-9d59-31a499b295ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064406300-0b01b908-9d31-43f9-89ce-a71b78b087eb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064424255-617844bc-13d4-4f1c-ae17-4c5cf4298153.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064433303-c8e2180a-abb4-4c87-b7c1-88ae127963b1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这两个做是事情是一样的！<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783064502701-fe230225-1811-4a57-bea9-7e68491639f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件应用-urlencoded的解析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783071689517-0c25854a-00fb-454e-a08b-2ee4824b5258.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783071718023-c378a52a-2e29-4317-9a3d-0f99b8e96329.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express里面有解析body的一个中间件了。express。json<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783071856802-9bf4987f-f140-4f0d-99ca-8e5d79b22e71.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>写一个对应的代码片段，因为我们经常用<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783071909729-e42392d2-d3d2-45d1-ba7c-2086039c16ed.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们来到这个地方<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072505934-73ae833a-a1f4-4183-9696-4d6a288479eb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>拷贝上面右边的代码，来这里<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072544366-466af659-124d-485b-8433-5c9cbf4b7825.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072571605-d1020d5b-7d7f-429e-beaa-235c7e92b881.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里的逗号是自己加的<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072609752-6e38e477-bfdd-4a90-8935-1590a3aec609.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>让代码跑起来<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072693503-8723f9d1-5ac5-4802-9d8e-0a85523b4867.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072701551-493da58b-59c3-4330-9813-ff21724ca881.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072746826-ca917799-76c2-410a-b4ea-731e5c943754.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要加一个中间件解析才可以<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072784012-20c35904-ff14-422a-b65e-86492800ae88.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072860849-e3971eea-a67d-4e13-9a03-250f2fbad2c0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783072877244-9c5e9fca-4f7a-42fb-bd43-567875c4564a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>因为qs已经不用了，如果我们要用的话，会出现警告，我们要加选中的那个就会取消警告<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783073091298-4c9274e2-eb36-4459-81da-1602a1f02df1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件应用-请求日志记录（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783073226884-29d84252-3fdd-4ea9-8ef7-1dbffde4db1c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783086988276-23cf54a7-1835-4377-8ad9-40ba9a057697.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087055762-36c5820a-34d3-45bf-abba-f6ea15485b8c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087151311-9a5717c7-7603-4608-aa3a-e1f153d5d23f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们每次发的请求都会被combined拦截掉，然后把拦截的信息写入到我们对应的文件那里<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087247662-cb723b17-30c8-4be2-a638-548ce486f1df.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087285867-7c44d8db-11f9-4190-a50c-100841941c77.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件应用-单个文件上传（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087489018-ed7e1efb-a56b-483e-a82c-479e951d8fac.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087537346-86b0416d-4af6-4882-b285-607a4fc00400.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要使用这个中间件要自己安装<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087576822-8a5d5b48-5f5b-4a01-bc0a-8f00fbcb0a67.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087637225-b9167c4d-1751-467f-b606-23e92c7e7fe4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>文件上传</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783087760475-3b269e6b-5c16-4fd4-b748-2e5dd07b8dd8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件应用-多个文件上传（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783088043905-040e6578-9639-4ed7-bda0-78554db5a887.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783088360401-94a65379-4887-4a0a-a4b3-0ca0ec14f552.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783088298828-475b9629-f50a-45d7-9826-22cb2adda0e9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783088309668-8e56acf3-bd97-4f63-ab5b-509d9930a159.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>打印出来的是数组<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783088324526-c989b78b-b07b-48f2-998b-2cd820538416.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-中间件应用-formdata解析</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783089239995-fcc0ecde-31dd-4281-ae86-5826e9ae71f3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>form-data：文件上传。 any他是用来解析req.body数据的。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783089482200-576febf6-d4ed-4e21-840f-642c74dfff7c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783089715523-4458781b-e2f1-4da8-903a-c37b061a89fa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-其他参数类型的解析过程（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783089915170-3bc90292-83bc-4e33-a4cd-1977c5e8bc6d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783089984406-dedffc37-1eb8-428d-a37d-56c0b72a7359.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>上面那个图有打印出end的内容，但是下面那个图我们还没有写解析的代码。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783089992088-d3200117-867d-4643-bfcc-10b9515daf47.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090071454-6f785720-2e4c-4d23-9e95-aebd2092bb07.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个是解析queryString<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090103799-7b9a80b5-d39d-47c8-ac54-1688c4b8342c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>解析params,我们的id是不可以写死的，要写为动态路由（:id)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090271291-9fb0ab26-39a0-4803-a1bb-815b41fe8237.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090309287-e6e44b57-033b-4ee6-9bc4-20317896b13f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090376161-54370802-d9bf-4be6-ab4b-ed0522ac6ade.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090403629-0b523aae-d1a1-45bf-9074-dd5143d6d24c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>express-服务器响应数据的方式（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090580862-977e767b-7519-4502-8082-1bcb29976264.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090557234-fee081f3-6d8f-4f05-8f6b-c148d2ca1896.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090670587-e5acf56d-3132-4277-8bf1-1342852162e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090656321-f7e8090c-6904-44b2-bc6b-6f358464e523.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783090680251-a4067b61-cb70-48e1-a630-db5e7d55dcfc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-02T06:20:14.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T14:59:31.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/ece1ttmp1gtzmeac","slug":"ece1ttmp1gtzmeac","wordCount":680}